{"id":"F1069","verdict":"accept","strength":"medium","label":"1B","direction":"supports","note":"All prices verified: Ultima 30x $192/$221 (24-sample batch), 60x $238/$274 (18), 90x $329/$379 (12); AVITI $407/$469 (4); Ultra Q $1,015/$1,168 (2). All include QC, PCR-free prep, sequencing and analysis. No Illumina WGS is listed. The batch sizes differ, and the comparison to the $200 Illumina figure mixes an all-in price with a sequencing-only price, as the item says. The marginal-cost reading is better done per wafer (see the derived item): each batch fills about one wafer."},
